    # ... and accepted, which is what an administrator does with a file they patched. The
    # filters swallowed the only finding there was, which is what "Nothing checked." says.
    # The metrics still come, so a dashboard shows a zero rather than a gap.
    {
        'id': 'ok-core-file-modified-but-ignored',
